WEBVTT

00:34.007 --> 00:35.275
(This drama is a work of fiction.)

00:35.275 --> 00:36.510
(All characters, organizations,
and events in this drama are fictitious.)

00:36.510 --> 00:37.744
(This drama complied
with production guidelines...)

00:37.744 --> 00:38.979
(for filming child actors and animals.)

00:48.522 --> 00:50.123
He killed someone?

00:57.898 --> 01:00.567
He was just drunk
and talking nonsense, right?

01:57.290 --> 02:04.264
(Episode 5
Setting the Limit)

02:55.816 --> 02:56.750
So he was...

02:57.717 --> 02:58.552
a soldier.

03:07.360 --> 03:11.598
(Gun Accident at Special Forces Guard Post
One Dead, One Critically Injured)

03:11.598 --> 03:13.400
"Special forces gun accident."

03:15.468 --> 03:16.603
(Senior Officer Dead)

03:16.603 --> 03:18.305
(Special Forces Gun Accident
Sergeant Yun Receives Three-year Sentence)

03:19.706 --> 03:20.574
"Three-year sentence."

03:21.208 --> 03:22.209
"Critically injured?"

03:25.745 --> 03:26.646
"Sergeant Yun."

03:27.781 --> 03:28.682
Could it be...

03:29.883 --> 03:30.817
Yun Deok Hyun?

03:36.590 --> 03:37.457
Weren't you...

03:38.425 --> 03:39.826
going to feed the cats?

03:40.627 --> 03:41.495
I was.

03:41.495 --> 03:42.863
But I left my phone behind.

03:45.999 --> 03:47.434
I lost my phone too,

03:48.268 --> 03:49.302
so I was looking for it.

03:50.470 --> 03:52.305
Sorry if I was intruding.

03:52.305 --> 03:53.173
Did you see it?

04:04.084 --> 04:04.918
Are you...

04:05.785 --> 04:07.420
the Sergeant Yun...

04:09.756 --> 04:10.957
who killed someone?

04:16.029 --> 04:16.897
You're not, right?

04:18.999 --> 04:19.833
If you're not,

04:20.367 --> 04:21.768
then just say so.

04:21.768 --> 04:24.271
Don't make me misunderstand.

04:25.005 --> 04:25.839
It's not...

04:28.275 --> 04:29.109
a misunderstanding.

04:33.547 --> 04:35.248
I was in prison for three years...

04:37.384 --> 04:38.385
for killing someone.

04:42.989 --> 04:43.857
Why...

04:46.092 --> 04:47.260
did you kill them?

04:49.329 --> 04:50.864
Because he deserved to die.

05:11.184 --> 05:12.152
Hey.

05:12.819 --> 05:13.687
Hey!

05:14.721 --> 05:15.889
What are you doing?

05:16.456 --> 05:17.858
You seemed to be feeling uncomfortable.

05:19.025 --> 05:19.860
I...

05:21.628 --> 05:22.963
It's not that...

05:25.732 --> 05:27.834
I can tell by the look on your face.

05:34.207 --> 05:35.475
Just throw away my diving suit.

05:37.010 --> 05:38.578
Deok Hyun, where are you going?

05:39.646 --> 05:41.481
Wait. Are you leaving for good?

05:41.748 --> 05:42.883
That's so sudden!

05:42.883 --> 05:44.484
What's going on?

05:44.484 --> 05:47.254
Deok Hyun. Are you really leaving?

05:47.420 --> 05:48.688
Deok Hyun!

05:54.861 --> 05:55.929
And who...

05:57.164 --> 05:58.031
is this guy?

05:58.331 --> 05:59.199
Well,

06:00.600 --> 06:01.635
I'm here to see her.

06:02.536 --> 06:03.336
You...

06:04.337 --> 06:05.672
were seeing someone?

06:08.575 --> 06:09.476
Cha Jae Yun.

06:10.544 --> 06:11.411
How did you...

06:11.778 --> 06:12.612
Isn't this a surprise?

06:13.513 --> 06:14.481
I'm shocked too.

06:15.982 --> 06:18.685
I can't believe I came all the way
to this countryside to see you.

06:21.354 --> 06:23.857
I guess I do love you a lot.

06:25.959 --> 06:27.327
What are you waiting for?
Get your stuff.

06:31.231 --> 06:32.999
I'll let you swim...

06:33.834 --> 06:34.668
again.

06:55.989 --> 06:58.425
(Jeong Gi Tae)

07:01.394 --> 07:02.362
What?

07:02.362 --> 07:03.563
What's going on?

07:03.563 --> 07:05.131
I woke up and you were gone,

07:05.131 --> 07:06.833
and so was that diver girl.

07:08.502 --> 07:09.336
Stop crying.

07:11.905 --> 07:13.206
Did you run away together?

07:13.740 --> 07:15.775
I ran away, but I don't know about her.

07:16.910 --> 07:18.278
Maybe she heard what you said last night.

07:19.846 --> 07:20.680
Me?

07:21.248 --> 07:22.182
What did I say?

07:24.718 --> 07:26.319
I always talk nonsense when I'm drunk.

07:29.156 --> 07:30.157
It's not nonsense.

07:36.029 --> 07:37.764
It's true that I got him killed.

07:53.079 --> 07:55.448
She must've been disappointed in me.

08:04.257 --> 08:06.760
I was disappointed...

08:08.628 --> 08:09.462
in myself.

08:12.966 --> 08:14.301
- Jae Yun.
- Yes?

08:14.301 --> 08:15.168
Hello?

08:15.168 --> 08:17.103
- You really went to get Seo Anna?
- Yeah.

08:17.938 --> 08:19.039
Why would you go and bring her back?

08:19.039 --> 08:21.808
You promised to break up with her
and stay with me.

08:23.743 --> 08:26.746
A rematch between
former youth team rivals.

08:27.080 --> 08:28.415
Doesn't that sound awesome?

08:29.616 --> 08:31.985
And what if I end up losing?

08:31.985 --> 08:33.854
That's impossible.

08:37.224 --> 08:38.892
I know Seo Anna's skills.

08:38.892 --> 08:40.160
Her level is right below yours.

08:42.829 --> 08:45.098
Whatever. I'll leave it up to you, then.

08:47.667 --> 08:49.803
Jeez. She's being so annoying.

09:01.882 --> 09:03.350
We'll start over,

09:04.017 --> 09:04.851
Anna.

09:09.523 --> 09:10.590
I know it's silly.

09:11.791 --> 09:13.960
Even though I knew
what kind of person Jae Yun was,

09:16.463 --> 09:18.498
I came back to Seoul...

09:19.232 --> 09:20.667
just because he said
he'd let me swim again.

09:39.986 --> 09:41.888
It was as if my days in Parang-ri...

09:42.289 --> 09:43.890
didn't mean anything at all.

10:20.360 --> 10:21.862
I think I passed three minutes.

10:22.429 --> 10:23.663
I did pretty well, right?

10:29.836 --> 10:32.005
Holding your breath for a long time
isn't what's important.

10:34.307 --> 10:36.743
Then why am I doing this?

10:37.944 --> 10:40.780
It's to know your limit.

10:42.315 --> 10:44.618
Lasting longer underwater
isn't always a good thing.

10:45.986 --> 10:47.187
You need to know your limit...

10:49.189 --> 10:50.891
so you know when to let go
and make it back up alive.

10:56.496 --> 10:57.564
Yun Deok Hyun...

10:58.798 --> 11:00.300
It was as though his words...

11:01.768 --> 11:02.669
also...

11:04.538 --> 11:05.605
didn't mean anything.

11:31.331 --> 11:32.299
(Seafood Noodles)

11:38.471 --> 11:41.408
These aren't seafood noodles.
They just smell like seafood.

11:51.618 --> 11:53.687
(Best by Sep 16, 2024)

11:53.687 --> 11:54.454
The limit...

11:56.356 --> 11:58.959
Who decides that?

12:56.783 --> 12:58.451
Are we seriously getting this
for Nam Seok U too?

12:58.451 --> 12:59.252
(Seven years ago)

12:59.252 --> 13:01.054
It's not because of him.
It's only because of Jae Hui.

13:01.054 --> 13:02.856
It's as if he's our senior.

13:05.492 --> 13:07.093
Darn it.

13:08.461 --> 13:09.729
Rock, paper, scissors.

13:12.732 --> 13:14.000
Go and prepare it again.

13:19.039 --> 13:20.073
Hurry.

13:20.073 --> 13:21.041
Shut up!

13:27.747 --> 13:29.783
You idiot. I'm holding a gun.

13:29.783 --> 13:30.550
Understand?

13:31.084 --> 13:32.018
Look.

13:32.452 --> 13:33.687
Please, stop.

13:33.687 --> 13:35.422
You must be terrified.

13:36.490 --> 13:37.524
Stop this, sir.

13:37.757 --> 13:39.125
"Stop this, sir."

13:41.528 --> 13:42.863
This is dangerous.

13:43.497 --> 13:45.131
You're right. It's dangerous.

13:45.599 --> 13:48.268
You could get a bullet through your head
if you're not careful.

13:49.202 --> 13:51.938
So just listen to me, you fucker!

13:56.443 --> 13:58.545
I told you to stop bullying Jae Hui.

13:58.812 --> 13:59.579
Didn't I?

14:01.181 --> 14:03.717
Why are you so bent on bullying him?

14:04.618 --> 14:05.452
Why?

14:07.354 --> 14:08.221
"Why?"

14:08.788 --> 14:10.524
There's no reason.

14:11.158 --> 14:12.092
It's just fun.

14:14.961 --> 14:16.229
You bastard.

14:17.430 --> 14:18.298
Die!

14:19.166 --> 14:20.133
Die!

14:22.569 --> 14:23.403
You son of a bitch.

14:56.469 --> 14:58.138
Jae Hui. No.

14:58.705 --> 14:59.539
Jae Hui, no...

15:00.006 --> 15:00.841
Jae Hui.

15:02.108 --> 15:03.944
Jae Hui...

15:03.944 --> 15:04.778
No.

15:05.178 --> 15:07.280
Jae Hui, no...

15:07.948 --> 15:09.683
What are you doing? Get a medic!

15:11.384 --> 15:12.219
Jae Hui...

15:20.861 --> 15:21.695
Gi Tae!

15:22.596 --> 15:23.663
Jeong Gi Tae!

15:27.400 --> 15:28.235
What?

15:30.337 --> 15:31.771
- Jae Hui.
- Jae Hui!

16:32.866 --> 16:33.567
(Baek Su Jeong)

16:33.567 --> 16:34.701
Bitch.

16:35.335 --> 16:38.171
You haven't changed
one bit in the last ten years.

16:38.839 --> 16:39.739
You traitor.

16:46.146 --> 16:47.214
Perhaps...

16:49.049 --> 16:50.517
we might be struggling to survive...

16:51.084 --> 16:52.886
because we don't know our limits.

17:19.579 --> 17:21.781
We don't even know
that we've run out of breath.

17:32.592 --> 17:34.594
You said you were running away,
but you're here.

17:37.230 --> 17:38.165
Hey.

17:38.165 --> 17:39.032
Get up.

17:40.667 --> 17:41.535
Let's eat.

18:00.420 --> 18:01.788
What changed your mind?

18:02.088 --> 18:03.557
You acted like you'd never come.

18:04.457 --> 18:05.826
That's why I came.
So I'll never come back.

18:07.594 --> 18:10.497
Why do you always have to talk like that?

18:12.532 --> 18:14.334
Remember how you asked me
back on the island...

18:14.334 --> 18:16.303
why I was so obsessed with you?

18:16.970 --> 18:17.838
Did I?

18:20.307 --> 18:21.274
Well...

18:23.343 --> 18:24.978
I still can't forget...

18:26.947 --> 18:28.148
the stuff that Jae Hui said.

18:35.021 --> 18:37.324
Slow down. No one's stealing your food.

18:37.991 --> 18:39.559
It's just so tasty.

18:41.761 --> 18:44.364
He really isn't the Special Forces type.

18:45.131 --> 18:45.999
Don't you think?

18:46.433 --> 18:47.467
There's no such thing.

18:48.001 --> 18:50.704
Anyone can adjust after a while.

18:56.276 --> 18:57.277
I...

18:57.277 --> 18:58.512
I actually...

19:00.413 --> 19:02.616
joined the Special Forces
because I wanted to change.

19:07.454 --> 19:09.623
I didn't want to live like this
any longer.

19:11.591 --> 19:12.792
There's nothing wrong with you.

19:13.593 --> 19:15.395
The guys who bullied you are at fault.

19:16.530 --> 19:17.564
Even so...

19:19.833 --> 19:21.902
nothing will change
if I don't do anything.

19:27.107 --> 19:28.074
I should at least...

19:29.376 --> 19:30.544
make an effort.

19:41.955 --> 19:44.257
I wanted to bring you back out
into the world,

19:47.527 --> 19:49.196
but doing nothing
wouldn't change anything.

19:51.398 --> 19:52.365
So...

19:53.400 --> 19:55.936
that's why I've been trying
all sorts of things to convince you.

20:03.577 --> 20:04.911
I'm sorry about this.

20:05.178 --> 20:07.314
I don't have a bank account.

20:08.181 --> 20:09.216
That's a lot.

20:09.916 --> 20:11.318
You're paying for several months
in advance this time?

20:12.319 --> 20:13.720
This is my final payment.

20:14.554 --> 20:15.822
You've been paying for two years,

20:15.822 --> 20:17.791
but it was your first visit, wasn't it?

20:18.458 --> 20:19.826
There are lots of people like you.

20:20.327 --> 20:23.029
It's not easy to see
your loved ones in pain.

20:25.298 --> 20:27.400
Yeah, well... I guess.

20:28.969 --> 20:29.936
How did it go?

20:34.341 --> 20:36.076
He asked why you didn't
come sooner, right?

20:42.349 --> 20:43.450
Come back next time.

20:43.984 --> 20:45.886
We only accept
one month's payment at a time.

20:54.194 --> 20:55.362
I'm sorry.

20:55.362 --> 20:56.930
Please just accept it.

21:28.094 --> 21:29.429
I admire your courage.

21:30.497 --> 21:33.433
I didn't work up the courage.
I'm here to check my limit.

21:33.834 --> 21:34.901
What are you on about?

21:34.901 --> 21:35.902
Come on.

21:36.570 --> 21:37.704
Stop chatting.

21:38.738 --> 21:39.906
Let's start with a warm-up.

21:40.407 --> 21:41.241
Get ready...

21:55.889 --> 21:56.723
Hey.

21:57.524 --> 21:59.626
I heard you brought her back here.

21:59.626 --> 22:00.594
Are you kidding me?

22:00.961 --> 22:01.795
What?

22:02.729 --> 22:04.297
You liked her too, didn't you?

22:04.798 --> 22:05.665
Well...

22:05.966 --> 22:07.601
I like looking at her,

22:08.168 --> 22:10.370
but she has a nasty temper.

22:10.370 --> 22:12.439
Then just watch her quietly.

22:12.973 --> 22:14.241
If she's nice to look at, then it's fine.

22:15.075 --> 22:15.909
Shall I?

22:20.213 --> 22:21.481
She does give me butterflies.

22:22.949 --> 22:23.817
So,

22:24.251 --> 22:26.653
you're going to make her an athlete again?

22:28.054 --> 22:28.989
Of course not.

22:30.056 --> 22:32.459
She can't be an athlete with those skills.

22:33.260 --> 22:34.594
Ye Kyung...

22:34.995 --> 22:36.730
wasn't practicing hard these days,

22:37.397 --> 22:38.565
so I wanted to motivate her and stuff.

22:39.900 --> 22:40.834
"And stuff?"

22:41.434 --> 22:42.269
I wanted...

22:43.236 --> 22:44.838
to sleep with Anna too.

22:48.008 --> 22:50.277
You're insane.

22:51.111 --> 22:52.546
Ye Kyung's sexy...

22:52.979 --> 22:54.347
and Anna's cute.

22:55.215 --> 22:56.683
They're both my style.

23:02.155 --> 23:05.058
To be honest, I already knew...

23:06.059 --> 23:07.460
that this was my limit.

23:19.773 --> 23:20.640
I just...

23:21.474 --> 23:23.009
couldn't let go until now.

23:57.644 --> 23:58.945
It wasn't going to take long.

24:01.581 --> 24:02.649
You'll get yourself killed like that.

24:03.583 --> 24:04.851
You need to let go and come back up.

24:05.986 --> 24:06.987
That's how you survive.

24:10.390 --> 24:11.658
Was Yun Deok Hyun right?

24:12.826 --> 24:15.595
Would I survive if I let go?

24:19.900 --> 24:21.768
Can I really survive...

24:22.903 --> 24:23.870
even if I...

24:25.238 --> 24:26.306
give up swimming?

24:28.475 --> 24:30.977
You're not satisfied
with Han Ye Kyung alone?

24:32.679 --> 24:34.381
Can you really handle both of them?

24:34.381 --> 24:35.315
Hey, Seo Anna!

24:35.882 --> 24:37.250
Why are you stopping? Keep going!

24:40.954 --> 24:42.422
Where is she going?

24:42.856 --> 24:43.657
What?

24:47.360 --> 24:48.161
What?

24:51.164 --> 24:52.065
Are you hurting?

24:53.200 --> 24:54.034
Is it your shoulder?

24:58.672 --> 24:59.506
Are you crazy?

24:59.506 --> 25:00.774
Yeah, I am.

25:01.741 --> 25:03.777
You can't swim if you treat me like this.

25:04.177 --> 25:05.078
I won't, you jerk.

25:12.919 --> 25:13.854
Seo Anna.

25:15.155 --> 25:16.089
Have you lost your mind?

25:16.523 --> 25:17.390
Asshole.

25:19.693 --> 25:21.561
I didn't say anything.

25:22.696 --> 25:23.563
You jerk.

25:26.533 --> 25:29.002
I wasn't planning
on talking it out either.

25:31.104 --> 25:32.072
Han Ye Kyung.

25:33.406 --> 25:34.908
If you keep rolling like that,

25:36.109 --> 25:37.110
you'll end up like me.

25:39.746 --> 25:40.881
Don't trust Coach Cha...

25:44.718 --> 25:45.719
too much.

25:59.166 --> 26:01.268
(Award)

26:03.136 --> 26:04.104
I'm sorry.

26:04.738 --> 26:06.773
I'll find the next tenant myself,

26:06.773 --> 26:08.375
- so just for a month...
- All right.

26:08.809 --> 26:10.443
But you're so young.

26:10.443 --> 26:12.679
Why are you suddenly moving
to the countryside?

26:16.983 --> 26:17.951
I have to...

26:18.785 --> 26:20.520
let things go and go above water...

26:21.888 --> 26:23.056
to survive.

26:26.760 --> 26:29.062
Yes, please do that for me.

26:30.063 --> 26:30.997
Thank you.

26:47.013 --> 26:47.848
Mom.

26:49.483 --> 26:50.817
I'm doing a good job,

26:51.918 --> 26:52.752
right?

26:53.854 --> 26:55.555
There's no need to ask.

27:02.863 --> 27:03.864
Gosh.

27:04.598 --> 27:06.833
When did you ever do what I said...

27:06.833 --> 27:08.335
and stop when I told you to?

27:09.269 --> 27:10.971
You never listened to a word I said.

27:13.473 --> 27:14.941
When did I do that?

27:17.043 --> 27:18.078
I told you,

27:19.146 --> 27:22.716
the color of your medal doesn't matter
the slightest bit.

27:23.817 --> 27:24.684
And it's the same now.

27:25.519 --> 27:28.021
Whether you swim or not doesn't matter.

27:30.857 --> 27:32.659
My daughter, Seo Anna.

27:33.226 --> 27:36.263
Just do what you want, eat healthy,

27:36.530 --> 27:37.531
and live a comfortable life.

27:37.998 --> 27:38.932
That's all I want for you.

27:43.970 --> 27:47.040
I'll always be rooting for you.

27:50.544 --> 27:51.578
Seo Anna,

27:51.578 --> 27:52.512
stay strong!

28:19.072 --> 28:20.907
Do it properly.

28:20.907 --> 28:22.843
Come on, you little brat!

28:25.679 --> 28:26.880
I don't want to do this.

28:28.715 --> 28:31.818
I should've been the one
to go to Seoul, not Anna.

28:35.121 --> 28:36.323
It's not too late, you know.

28:43.129 --> 28:45.265
What? You're back already?

28:45.565 --> 28:47.234
Yeah, I am.

28:56.409 --> 28:57.377
How have you been?

29:09.189 --> 29:10.090
In the end...

29:11.791 --> 29:12.959
I came back to Parang-ri.

29:16.163 --> 29:17.063
But...

29:17.764 --> 29:18.865
things are different from before.

29:26.573 --> 29:28.408
Because the fact that I came back up...

29:35.215 --> 29:37.284
means I'm ready to dive back in.

29:38.985 --> 29:39.920
I'm so hungry.

29:44.224 --> 29:46.660
(Parang-ri diver Jo Mi Hyun)

30:27.767 --> 30:30.203
You're here.

30:32.205 --> 30:33.006
Were you...

30:34.508 --> 30:35.876
waiting for me?

30:39.613 --> 30:41.982
I came to tell you something
before I left.

30:49.256 --> 30:51.158
If it's an explanation about your past,

30:52.092 --> 30:52.959
there's no need.

30:54.294 --> 30:55.495
I didn't look up anything,

30:56.897 --> 30:58.031
and I'm not even curious.

30:59.466 --> 31:00.634
If you're really a bad guy,

31:02.202 --> 31:03.737
the police would've arrested you already.

31:08.975 --> 31:10.010
More than anything,

31:13.713 --> 31:15.015
it's not something...

31:16.917 --> 31:18.385
I should receive an apology for
or forgive.

31:29.696 --> 31:30.530
You should...

31:33.266 --> 31:34.334
swim again.

31:39.239 --> 31:41.107
That's what I came here to tell you.

31:44.411 --> 31:46.546
I was afraid I wouldn't be able to live...

31:47.547 --> 31:48.415
after quitting swimming.

31:53.353 --> 31:54.988
You know you're being silly, don't you?

31:59.092 --> 32:00.760
I felt it while I saw you diving.

32:00.760 --> 32:01.661
You...

32:02.529 --> 32:03.630
can swim again.

32:04.698 --> 32:06.700
Are you giving advice to a professional?

32:10.303 --> 32:11.238
Sorry.

32:12.272 --> 32:13.573
It wasn't my place.

32:16.076 --> 32:18.712
But I'm not scared anymore.

32:28.255 --> 32:29.723
I'm glad you seem okay.

32:31.024 --> 32:31.858
Well, then.

32:35.896 --> 32:36.863
Do you want...

32:39.699 --> 32:40.734
to swim together?

32:48.608 --> 32:49.476
This time,

32:52.012 --> 32:53.146
I'll teach you.

33:01.655 --> 33:03.623
Because now I know that there's someone...

33:06.726 --> 33:07.961
willing to dive into the water...

33:10.030 --> 33:11.097
with me.

33:35.489 --> 33:36.523
What?

33:36.523 --> 33:38.525
How did you know where I live?

33:38.992 --> 33:39.793
Jeez.

33:39.793 --> 33:43.163
I've been chasing Yun Deok Hyun around
for three years.

33:43.463 --> 33:46.967
Tracking down an athlete whose name
and face are known is a piece of cake.

33:49.202 --> 33:50.804
Why are you here, then?

33:54.441 --> 33:56.409
Yun Deok Hyun...

33:57.010 --> 33:58.912
It seems like he went back to the island.

34:01.214 --> 34:03.750
No way. He took his stuff and left.

34:05.485 --> 34:07.020
I'm sure of it.

34:08.221 --> 34:09.156
So...

34:09.890 --> 34:11.091
if you meet him again,

34:13.293 --> 34:14.194
can you...

34:15.729 --> 34:17.063
pull him out of the water?

34:22.736 --> 34:24.437
I saw how he was smiling...

34:26.606 --> 34:28.074
when he was with you.

34:32.979 --> 34:33.847
Hey!

34:40.687 --> 34:41.588
He was smiling...

34:42.689 --> 34:44.291
when he was with me?

34:51.198 --> 34:52.465
Get up.

35:28.335 --> 35:30.337
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
